& [PlanTruthTable] is exhaustive
  + exact profile and nonzero projection and reference identities proceed
  + oversized encoding returns resource before decode
  + malformed, unknown, omitted, or mistyped JSON returns json
  + wrong profile returns profile
  + zero projection identity returns projection_identity
  + zero entry reference returns entry_reference_identity

& [PreflightTruthTable] is closed
  + current form fault returns preflight with exact nested fault
  + CompleteLocal plus EligibleLocalNtfs proceeds
  + CompleteLocal with any other disposition returns preflight_disposition
  + CompleteRemote, OpenFault, QueryFault, and ObservationFault return preflight_disposition
  + no variant is inferred or normalized

& [StabilityTruthTable] is closed
  + current lower fault returns stability with exact nested fault
  + successful Directory seed proceeds
  + successful RegularFile seed returns kind
  + direct stable-pair input is absent

& [JoinTruthTable] is exact
  + plan reference unequal to pair returns entry_reference
  + complete strong identity mismatch returns identity
  + validated drive root with no final component returns input_root_component
  + validated volume-GUID root with no final component returns final_path_component
  + either path component unequal to stable policy component returns component
  + all equality uses exact Rust value equality without normalization or physical lookup

& [ProjectionMappingTable] is closed
  + relative_path None
  + kind RootDirectory
  + mode_class Directory
  + attributes exact seed
  + identity exact seed already joined to preflight root
  + number_of_links exact seed
